NOTE ON DATA VS. CODE

This MIT License covers the SOURCE CODE of the Chronas API only.

The historical DATA served by this API — including but not limited to province
and area geometry (`/v1/metadata?type=g&f=provinces`), and per-year ruler,
culture, religion, capital, and related entity data (`/v1/areas/{year}`,
`/v1/metadata/...`) — is licensed separately under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0), because it is
substantially derived from Wikipedia and other CC BY-SA sources.

See DATA-LICENSE.md for the terms that apply to the data.
